      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "I would recommend prioritizing Zone A for the first deployment. Despite its high-density residential area, Zone A faces more significant health and infrastructure challenges, including limited access to medical care and informal housing that may exacerbate hygiene and sanitation issues. By prioritizing this zone, you can provide much-needed relief and support the establishment of a strong foundation for long-term recovery. This will also enable you to establish a demonstration effect, which can help build trust among the community.",
